## 3. How to Deploy the Cloud Function Safely

Instead of typing files manually, use the automated setup script (`setup_and_deploy.sh`) provided in your workspace. It does the following:

1. Reset your `gcloud` config to target your project number **`761338287468`**.
2. Create a clean project directory (`prevleak-backend`).
3. Write a production-grade, highly secure Node.js 20 script for your `recordVesselData` telemetry receiver.
4. Write the corresponding dependency file (`package.json`).
5. Run the native deployment command to spin up your HTTPS-triggered telemetry receiver endpoint.

